messages.content:
This screen belongs to a clickable mockup of: A tiny bakery website

Show this screen: A page about the bakers of a tiny bakery

Screens of this mockup, as a tree:
@home: the first screen of A tiny bakery website
  @bread-shelf: Bread section of a bakery website on a phone, with sourdough, rye and baguette listed with prices
    @rye-details: Detail page for a rye bread loaf at a bakery website on a phone, with ingredients and add-to-cart button (not made yet)
    @baguette-details: Detail page for a baguette at a bakery website on a phone, with ingredients and add-to-cart button (not made yet)
  @my-account: Account screen of a bakery website on a phone with order history and saved pickup slots
  @pastry-case: Pastry section of a bakery website on a phone, with croissants, danish and eclairs listed with prices
    @croissant-details: The croissant details screen, opened by "Details" (not made yet)
    @danish-details: The danish details screen, opened by "Details" (not made yet)
    @eclair-details: The eclair details screen, opened by "Details" (not made yet)
  @cake-orders: Custom cake order form for a bakery website on a phone (not made yet)
  @sourdough-details: Detail page for a sourdough loaf at a bakery website on a phone, with ingredients, ferment time and add-to-cart button (not made yet)
  @berry-tart-details: Detail page for a berry tart at a bakery website on a phone, with ingredients, allergens and add-to-cart button (not made yet)
  @cart: Cart screen of a bakery website on a phone, with cinnamon knots and a sourdough loaf, totals and a checkout button (not made yet)

Design it for a phone screen, at most 390 px wide.

Design this as a clearly different alternative to the obvious layout: change the structure, grouping or navigation, not just the wording.

